# Build context for infra/docker/Dockerfile.service and Dockerfile.storefront.
# Keep it small: dependencies are installed and code is compiled inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results*
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
**/*.log
# Generated Prisma clients are host-specific (engine binaries); the image regenerates them.
apps/*/src/generated

# Secrets and local config
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Tooling state, docs and tests the images never need
.git
.github
.unlazy
.impeccable
.claude
docs
tests
infra/k8s
**/e2e
**/*.md
!apps/storefront/AGENTS.md
